{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31000","headline":"赠隐者 · 薛能","name":"赠隐者","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"门前虽有径，绝向世间行。\n薙草因逢药，移花便得莺。\n甘贫原是道，苦学不爲名。\n莫怪苍髭晚，无机任世情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛能","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31000.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31000","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、古籍注评：《御选唐诗》（中文维基文库，CC BY-SA 4.0，https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/御選唐詩_(四庫全書本)）"}